{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49529","headline":"木兰花 · 魏承班","name":"木兰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小芙蓉，香旖旎，碧玉堂深清似水。\n闭宝匣，掩金铺，倚屏拖袖愁如醉。\n迟迟好景烟花媚，曲渚鸳鸯眠锦翅。\n凝然愁望静相思，一双笑靥嚬香蘂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏承班","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}